          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.linalg import cholesky, solve_triangular\nfrom scipy.special import logsumexp\nfrom sklearn.mixture import GaussianMixture\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(231)\n\n# Bangkitkan 3 klaster Gaussian miring (anisotropik berkorelasi) untuk uji eksak posterior GMM\ncov_true = [\n    np.array([[1.40, 1.05], [1.05, 1.10]]),\n    np.array([[1.20, -0.95], [-0.95, 1.05]]),\n    np.array([[0.45, 0.05], [0.05, 0.55]]),\n]\nmu_true = [np.array([-2.2, -0.8]), np.array([2.4, 0.9]), np.array([0.2, 3.0])]\nX = np.vstack([\n    rng.multivariate_normal(mu_true[0], cov_true[0], size=120),\n    rng.multivariate_normal(mu_true[1], cov_true[1], size=100),\n    rng.multivariate_normal(mu_true[2], cov_true[2], size=80),\n])\n\ndef log_mvn_pdf_cholesky(X_in: np.ndarray, mu: np.ndarray, cov: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    \"\"\"Hitung log N(x | mu, cov) secara stabil numerik lewat faktorisasi Cholesky.\"\"\"\n    d = X_in.shape[1]\n    L = cholesky(cov, lower=True)\n    log_det = 2.0 * np.sum(np.log(np.diag(L)))\n    diff = (X_in - mu).T  # shape (d, N)\n    sol = solve_triangular(L, diff, lower=True)\n    mahal_sq = np.sum(sol ** 2, axis=0)\n    return -0.5 * (d * np.log(2.0 * np.pi) + log_det + mahal_sq)\n\ndef compute_gmm_posterior(\n    X_in: np.ndarray, weights: np.ndarray, means: np.ndarray, covs: np.ndarray\n) -> tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    \"\"\"Kembalikan (log_density p(x), tanggung jawab posterior gamma_ik) via Log-Sum-Exp.\"\"\"\n    n, k = X_in.shape[0], len(weights)\n    log_weighted = np.empty((n, k), dtype=float)\n    for j in range(k):\n        log_weighted[:, j] = np.log(weights[j]) + log_mvn_pdf_cholesky(X_in, means[j], covs[j])\n    log_dens = logsumexp(log_weighted, axis=1)\n    gamma = np.exp(log_weighted - log_dens[:, None])\n    return log_dens, gamma\n\n# 1) Verifikasi eksak terhadap sklearn.mixture.GaussianMixture pada parameter terlatih identik\nsk_gmm = GaussianMixture(n_components=3, covariance_type=\"full\", n_init=5, random_state=42).fit(X)\nlog_p_our, gamma_our = compute_gmm_posterior(X, sk_gmm.weights_, sk_gmm.means_, sk_gmm.covariances_)\nlog_p_sk = sk_gmm.score_samples(X)\ngamma_sk = sk_gmm.predict_proba(X)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Verifikasi Scratch (Cholesky + Log-Sum-Exp) vs Scikit-Learn GaussianMixture ===\")\nprint(f\"Max |log p(x) Scratch - Sklearn|   : {np.max(np.abs(log_p_our - log_p_sk)):.2e}\")\nprint(f\"Max |gamma_ik Scratch - Sklearn|   : {np.max(np.abs(gamma_our - gamma_sk)):.2e}\")\nprint(f\"Rata-rata log-likelihood / sampel  : {np.mean(log_p_our):.6f}\")\n\n# 2) Demonstrasi Batas Matematis K-Means: GMM Isotropik (pi_k = 1/K, Sigma_k = sigma^2 * I) saat sigma -> 0+\ncentroids = np.array(mu_true)\ndists_sq = np.sum((X[:, None, :] - centroids[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)\nhard_kmeans = np.argmin(dists_sq, axis=1)\npis_unif = np.full(3, 1.0 / 3.0)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Konvergensi Batas GMM Isotropik (sigma -> 0+) Menuju Hard Assignment K-Means ===\")\nprint(\"  sigma  | Mean Entropy H(gamma) | Mean max(gamma) | Proporsi gamma > 0.99 | Agree K-Means\")\nprint(\"-\" * 88)\nfor sigma in [3.0, 1.5, 0.8, 0.35, 0.12, 0.03]:\n    covs_iso = np.array([(sigma ** 2) * np.eye(2) for _ in range(3)])\n    _, g_iso = compute_gmm_posterior(X, pis_unif, centroids, covs_iso)\n    g_clip = np.clip(g_iso, 1e-15, 1.0)\n    norm_H = float(np.mean(-np.sum(g_clip * np.log(g_clip), axis=1) / np.log(3.0)))\n    max_g = float(np.mean(np.max(g_iso, axis=1)))\n    sharp_pct = float(100.0 * np.mean(np.max(g_iso, axis=1) > 0.99))\n    agree_pct = float(100.0 * np.mean(np.argmax(g_iso, axis=1) == hard_kmeans))\n    print(f\"  {sigma:5.2f}  | {norm_H:21.6f} | {max_g:15.6f} | {sharp_pct:20.1f}% | {agree_pct:12.1f}%\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi Scratch (Cholesky + Log-Sum-Exp) vs Scikit-Learn GaussianMixture ===\nMax |log p(x) Scratch - Sklearn|   : 1.78e-15\nMax |gamma_ik Scratch - Sklearn|   : 8.88e-16\nRata-rata log-likelihood / sampel  : -3.258342\n\n=== 2. Konvergensi Batas GMM Isotropik (sigma -> 0+) Menuju Hard Assignment K-Means ===\n  sigma  | Mean Entropy H(gamma) | Mean max(gamma) | Proporsi gamma > 0.99 | Agree K-Means\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   3.00  |              0.842984 |        0.573474 |                  0.0% |        100.0%\n   1.50  |              0.315568 |        0.864181 |                 22.3% |        100.0%\n   0.80  |              0.076250 |        0.967015 |                 78.3% |        100.0%\n   0.35  |              0.009316 |        0.996491 |                 96.3% |        100.0%\n   0.12  |              0.000065 |        0.999990 |                100.0% |        100.0%\n   0.03  |              0.000000 |        1.000000 |                100.0% |        100.0%",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi Scratch (Cholesky + Log-Sum-Exp) vs Scikit-Learn GaussianMixture ===\nMax |log p(x) Scratch - Sklearn|   : 1.78e-15\nMax |gamma_ik Scratch - Sklearn|   : 8.88e-16\nRata-rata log-likelihood / sampel  : -3.258342\n\n=== 2. Konvergensi Batas GMM Isotropik (sigma -> 0+) Menuju Hard Assignment K-Means ===\n  sigma  | Mean Entropy H(gamma) | Mean max(gamma) | Proporsi gamma > 0.99 | Agree K-Means\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   3.00  |              0.842984 |        0.573474 |                  0.0% |        100.0%\n   1.50  |              0.315568 |        0.864181 |                 22.3% |        100.0%\n   0.80  |              0.076250 |        0.967015 |                 78.3% |        100.0%\n   0.35  |              0.009316 |        0.996491 |                 96.3% |        100.0%\n   0.12  |              0.000065 |        0.999990 |                100.0% |        100.0%\n   0.03  |              0.000000 |        1.000000 |                100.0% |        100.0%",
