          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score, v_measure_score\nfrom sklearn.mixture import GaussianMixture\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2312)\n\n# Tiga segmen nasabah elipsoidal miring berkorelasi tinggi & ukuran tidak seimbang (260, 220, 120)\n# Sumbu 0: Pendapatan terstandardisasi, Sumbu 1: Skor utilisasi kredit terstandardisasi\nc0 = rng.multivariate_normal([0.0, 0.0], [[3.2, 2.55], [2.55, 2.25]], size=260)\nc1 = rng.multivariate_normal([0.0, 2.3], [[3.2, 2.55], [2.55, 2.25]], size=220)\nc2 = rng.multivariate_normal([2.2, -0.5], [[0.35, -0.22], [-0.22, 0.30]], size=120)\n\nX = np.vstack([c0, c1, c2])\ny_true = np.array([0] * 260 + [1] * 220 + [2] * 120)\n\nkm = KMeans(n_clusters=3, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=5, random_state=42).fit(X)\ngmm_sph = GaussianMixture(n_components=3, covariance_type=\"spherical\", n_init=5, random_state=42).fit(X)\ngmm_full = GaussianMixture(n_components=3, covariance_type=\"full\", n_init=5, random_state=42).fit(X)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Arena Klaster Elipsoidal Miring & Varians Timpang (K-Means vs GMM) ===\")\nprint(\"Model                     |    ARI   | V-Measure | Avg Log-Lik\")\nprint(\"-\" * 64)\nfor name, preds, ll in [\n    (\"KMeans++ (Hard Voronoi)\", km.labels_, float(\"nan\")),\n    (\"GMM (spherical)\", gmm_sph.predict(X), float(gmm_sph.score(X))),\n    (\"GMM (full covariance)\", gmm_full.predict(X), float(gmm_full.score(X))),\n]:\n    ari = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_true, preds))\n    vm = float(v_measure_score(y_true, preds))\n    ll_str = f\"{ll:11.4f}\" if np.isfinite(ll) else \"        N/A\"\n    print(f\"{name:25s} | {ari:8.4f} | {vm:9.4f} | {ll_str}\")\n\n# 2) Triage Ketidakpastian Berbasis Entropi Posterior gamma_ik\nprobs = gmm_full.predict_proba(X)\npreds_full = gmm_full.predict(X)\n# Petakan ID klaster GMM ke label ground truth lewat mayoritas untuk audit akurasi bucket\nmapping = {}\nfor k in range(3):\n    mask = preds_full == k\n    vals, cnts = np.unique(y_true[mask], return_counts=True)\n    mapping[k] = int(vals[np.argmax(cnts)])\nmapped_preds = np.array([mapping[p] for p in preds_full])\nis_err = mapped_preds != y_true\n\np_safe = np.clip(probs, 1e-15, 1.0)\nnorm_entropy = -np.sum(p_safe * np.log(p_safe), axis=1) / np.log(3.0)\n\nhi_conf = norm_entropy < 0.25\nborderline = ~hi_conf\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Triage Keputusan Bisnis via Entropi Posterior H(gamma_i) / log(K) ===\")\nprint(f\"Total Sampel                : {len(X)}\")\nprint(f\"Auto-Route (H < 0.25)       : {np.sum(hi_conf):3d} sampel ({100*np.mean(hi_conf):4.1f}%) | Error Rate = {100*np.mean(is_err[hi_conf]):5.2f}%\")\nprint(f\"Human Review (H >= 0.25)    : {np.sum(borderline):3d} sampel ({100*np.mean(borderline):4.1f}%) | Error Rate = {100*np.mean(is_err[borderline]):5.2f}%\")\nprint(f\"Rasio Konsentrasi Kesalahan : {np.mean(is_err[borderline]) / max(np.mean(is_err[hi_conf]), 1e-9):.1f}x lebih tinggi di zona borderline\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Arena Klaster Elipsoidal Miring & Varians Timpang (K-Means vs GMM) ===\nModel                     |    ARI   | V-Measure | Avg Log-Lik\n----------------------------------------------------------------\nKMeans++ (Hard Voronoi)   |   0.2789 |    0.3893 |         N/A\nGMM (spherical)           |   0.2395 |    0.3745 |     -3.8295\nGMM (full covariance)     |   0.9182 |    0.8811 |     -3.3948\n\n=== 2. Triage Keputusan Bisnis via Entropi Posterior H(gamma_i) / log(K) ===\nTotal Sampel                : 600\nAuto-Route (H < 0.25)       : 504 sampel (84.0%) | Error Rate =  0.20%\nHuman Review (H >= 0.25)    :  96 sampel (16.0%) | Error Rate = 17.71%\nRasio Konsentrasi Kesalahan : 89.3x lebih tinggi di zona borderline",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Arena Klaster Elipsoidal Miring & Varians Timpang (K-Means vs GMM) ===\nModel                     |    ARI   | V-Measure | Avg Log-Lik\n----------------------------------------------------------------\nKMeans++ (Hard Voronoi)   |   0.2789 |    0.3893 |         N/A\nGMM (spherical)           |   0.2395 |    0.3745 |     -3.8295\nGMM (full covariance)     |   0.9182 |    0.8811 |     -3.3948\n\n=== 2. Triage Keputusan Bisnis via Entropi Posterior H(gamma_i) / log(K) ===\nTotal Sampel                : 600\nAuto-Route (H < 0.25)       : 504 sampel (84.0%) | Error Rate =  0.20%\nHuman Review (H >= 0.25)    :  96 sampel (16.0%) | Error Rate = 17.71%\nRasio Konsentrasi Kesalahan : 89.3x lebih tinggi di zona borderline",
