          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `em_one_step_elbo_audit(X, weights, means, covs, reg_covar=1e-6)` dalam NumPy/SciPy yang mengeksekusi tepat **satu siklus lengkap E-Step + M-Step** menggunakan Cholesky (`cholesky`, `solve_triangular`) dan `logsumexp`, lalu mengembalikan `(round(ll_before, 4), round(elbo_after_e, 4), round(ll_after_m, 4), is_monotone)` di mana `is_monotone = bool(ll_after_m >= ll_before - 1e-10)`. Verifikasi bahwa `elbo_after_e` identik presisi dengan `ll_before` dan `ll_after_m >= ll_before`!",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.linalg import cholesky, solve_triangular\nfrom scipy.special import logsumexp\n\ndef em_one_step_elbo_audit(X, weights, means, covs, reg_covar: float = 1e-6) -> tuple[float, float, float, bool]:\n    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)\n    pis = np.asarray(weights, dtype=float).copy()\n    mus = np.asarray(means, dtype=float).copy()\n    covs = np.asarray(covs, dtype=float).copy()\n    # TODO: hitung ll_before -> E-Step (gamma & elbo_e) -> M-Step (pis_new, mus_new, covs_new + reg_covar*I) -> ll_after\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2320)\nX_s = np.vstack([rng.normal([-1.5, 0.0], 0.7, size=(20, 2)), rng.normal([1.5, 1.0], 0.8, size=(20, 2))])\nw_0 = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\nm_0 = np.array([[-0.3, -0.5], [0.4, 0.3]])\nc_0 = np.array([np.eye(2) * 1.5, np.eye(2) * 1.5])\nprint(em_one_step_elbo_audit(X_s, w_0, m_0, c_0))",
