          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\nfrom sklearn.mixture import GaussianMixture\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2332)\n\n# REZIM A: Dimensi Rendah (d=3, N_train=600) dengan Kovarians Elipsoidal Berbeda-Beda\ncovs_a = [\n    np.array([[2.2, 1.6, 0.5], [1.6, 1.5, 0.3], [0.5, 0.3, 0.6]]),\n    np.array([[1.4, -1.0, 0.4], [-1.0, 1.3, -0.2], [0.4, -0.2, 0.9]]),\n    np.array([[0.4, 0.1, -0.2], [0.1, 0.5, 0.25], [-0.2, 0.25, 1.8]]),\n]\nmus_a = [[-1.5, 0.0, 0.0], [1.5, 0.8, 0.2], [0.2, -1.6, 0.4]]\nXa_tr = np.vstack([rng.multivariate_normal(m, c, size=200) for m, c in zip(mus_a, covs_a)])\nXa_te = np.vstack([rng.multivariate_normal(m, c, size=100) for m, c in zip(mus_a, covs_a)])\nya_te = np.repeat(np.arange(3), 100)\n\n# REZIM B: Dimensi Tinggi Sampel Terbatas (d=35, N_train=220, K=4) -> N_k ~ 55 << d*(d+1)/2 = 630!\nmus_b = np.zeros((4, 35))\nfor k in range(4):\n    mus_b[k, k * 6 : (k + 1) * 6] = 2.1\nscales_b = [np.linspace(0.7, 1.3, 35), np.linspace(1.2, 0.6, 35), np.full(35, 0.95), np.linspace(0.8, 1.1, 35)]\nXb_tr = np.vstack([rng.normal(mus_b[k], scales_b[k], size=(55, 35)) for k in range(4)])\nXb_te = np.vstack([rng.normal(mus_b[k], scales_b[k], size=(55, 35)) for k in range(4)])\nyb_te = np.repeat(np.arange(4), 55)\n\ndef run_regime(title: str, Xtr: np.ndarray, Xte: np.ndarray, yte: np.ndarray, k: int):\n    print(f\"=== {title} ===\")\n    print(\"cov_type  | #Params | Train LL | Test LL  |     BIC    | Test ARI\")\n    print(\"-\" * 68)\n    for ct in [\"full\", \"tied\", \"diag\", \"spherical\"]:\n        gm = GaussianMixture(n_components=k, covariance_type=ct, reg_covar=1e-4, n_init=3, random_state=42).fit(Xtr)\n        tr_ll = float(gm.score(Xtr))\n        te_ll = float(gm.score(Xte))\n        bic = float(gm.bic(Xtr))\n        n_p = int(round((gm.aic(Xtr) + 2.0 * tr_ll * len(Xtr)) / 2.0))\n        ari = float(adjusted_rand_score(yte, gm.predict(Xte)))\n        print(f\"{ct:9s} | {n_p:7d} | {tr_ll:8.3f} | {te_ll:8.3f} | {bic:10.1f} | {ari:8.4f}\")\n\nrun_regime(\"Rezim A: Low-D Elipsoidal Kuat (d=3, N_train=600, K=3)\", Xa_tr, Xa_te, ya_te, k=3)\nprint()\nrun_regime(\"Rezim B: High-D Sampel Terbatas (d=35, N_train=220, K=4)\", Xb_tr, Xb_te, yb_te, k=4)",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Rezim A: Low-D Elipsoidal Kuat (d=3, N_train=600, K=3) ===\ncov_type  | #Params | Train LL | Test LL  |     BIC    | Test ARI\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nfull      |      29 |   -4.766 |   -4.745 |     5905.0 |   0.7913\ntied      |      17 |   -5.084 |   -5.058 |     6210.0 |   0.5397\ndiag      |      20 |   -4.986 |   -4.943 |     6111.3 |   0.5478\nspherical |      14 |   -5.109 |   -5.068 |     6219.8 |   0.5931\n\n=== Rezim B: High-D Sampel Terbatas (d=35, N_train=220, K=4) ===\ncov_type  | #Params | Train LL | Test LL  |     BIC    | Test ARI\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nfull      |    2663 |  -39.947 |  -79.182 |    31939.9 |   0.7973\ntied      |     773 |  -47.161 |  -52.614 |    24920.1 |   1.0000\ndiag      |     283 |  -47.761 |  -50.003 |    22541.4 |   1.0000\nspherical |     147 |  -48.819 |  -50.211 |    22273.2 |   1.0000",
          "actualOutput": "=== Rezim A: Low-D Elipsoidal Kuat (d=3, N_train=600, K=3) ===\ncov_type  | #Params | Train LL | Test LL  |     BIC    | Test ARI\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nfull      |      29 |   -4.766 |   -4.745 |     5905.0 |   0.7913\ntied      |      17 |   -5.084 |   -5.058 |     6210.0 |   0.5397\ndiag      |      20 |   -4.986 |   -4.943 |     6111.3 |   0.5478\nspherical |      14 |   -5.109 |   -5.068 |     6219.8 |   0.5931\n\n=== Rezim B: High-D Sampel Terbatas (d=35, N_train=220, K=4) ===\ncov_type  | #Params | Train LL | Test LL  |     BIC    | Test ARI\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nfull      |    2663 |  -39.947 |  -79.182 |    31939.9 |   0.7973\ntied      |     773 |  -47.161 |  -52.614 |    24920.1 |   1.0000\ndiag      |     283 |  -47.761 |  -50.003 |    22541.4 |   1.0000\nspherical |     147 |  -48.819 |  -50.211 |    22273.2 |   1.0000",
