          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `gmm_param_budget_and_reg_audit(S_emp, K, cov_type, reg_covar)` menggunakan NumPy & SciPy (`cholesky`) yang: (1) menghitung total parameter bebas eksak `n_params` bagi GMM berukuran `(K, d)` (dengan `d = S_emp.shape[0]`) untuk `cov_type` di antara `full`/`tied`/`diag`/`spherical`; (2) meregularisasi matriks kovarians empiris singular `S_reg = S_emp + reg_covar * I_d`; dan (3) menghitung `log_det` via faktorisasi Cholesky serta *condition number* $\\kappa = \\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min}$ via `np.linalg.eigvalsh`. Kembalikan `(n_params, round(log_det, 4), round(cond_num, 2))`.",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.linalg import cholesky\n\ndef gmm_param_budget_and_reg_audit(S_emp, K: int, cov_type: str, reg_covar: float) -> tuple[int, float, float]:\n    S = np.asarray(S_emp, dtype=float)\n    d = S.shape[0]\n    # TODO: hitung n_params sesuai cov_type -> bentuk S_reg = S + reg_covar*I -> log_det via Cholesky & cond_num via eigvalsh\n    pass\n\nS_rank_def = np.array([[1.0, 2.0, 0.5], [2.0, 4.0, 1.0], [0.5, 1.0, 1.25]])\nprint(gmm_param_budget_and_reg_audit(S_rank_def, K=6, cov_type=\"full\", reg_covar=1e-2))",
