          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.linalg import cholesky\n\ndef gmm_param_budget_and_reg_audit(S_emp, K: int, cov_type: str, reg_covar: float) -> tuple[int, float, float]:\n    S = np.asarray(S_emp, dtype=float)\n    d = S.shape[0]\n    if cov_type == \"full\":\n        cov_p = K * d * (d + 1) // 2\n    elif cov_type == \"tied\":\n        cov_p = d * (d + 1) // 2\n    elif cov_type == \"diag\":\n        cov_p = K * d\n    elif cov_type == \"spherical\":\n        cov_p = K\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(cov_type)\n    n_params = (K - 1) + K * d + cov_p\n    S_reg = S + reg_covar * np.eye(d)\n    L = cholesky(S_reg, lower=True)\n    log_det = float(2.0 * np.sum(np.log(np.diag(L))))\n    eigs = np.linalg.eigvalsh(S_reg)\n    cond_num = float(eigs[-1] / eigs[0])\n    return (int(n_params), round(log_det, 4), round(cond_num, 2))\n```"
