          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.special import digamma, gammaln, logsumexp\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(234)\n\n# 1) Simulasi Konstruksi Stick-Breaking Dirichlet Process: v_k ~ Beta(1, alpha_0)\nprint(\"=== 1. Simulasi Stick-Breaking Dirichlet Process (Rata-Rata 500 Realisasi, K_trunc=15) ===\")\nprint(\"alpha_0 | E[sum pi_1..3] | E[sum pi_1..5] | E[Komponen Aktif pi_k > 0.01]\")\nprint(\"-\" * 74)\nfor alpha0 in [0.2, 1.0, 4.0]:\n    v = rng.beta(1.0, alpha0, size=(500, 15))\n    rem = np.ones((500, 15))\n    rem[:, 1:] = np.cumprod(1.0 - v[:, :-1], axis=1)\n    pis_sb = v * rem\n    top3 = float(np.mean(np.sum(pis_sb[:, :3], axis=1)))\n    top5 = float(np.mean(np.sum(pis_sb[:, :5], axis=1)))\n    active = float(np.mean(np.sum(pis_sb > 0.01, axis=1)))\n    print(f\"{alpha0:7.1f} | {top3:14.4f} | {top5:14.4f} | {active:29.2f}\")\n\n# 2) Mesin 1D Variational Bayesian GMM (Mean-Field CAVI) dari Nol dengan Pemangkasan Otomatis\n# Data sejati memiliki tepat 3 gugus (N=360), tetapi kita berikan kapasitas berlebih K_max=7!\nx = np.concatenate([\n    rng.normal(-4.2, 0.55, size=120),\n    rng.normal(0.0, 0.65, size=130),\n    rng.normal(4.5, 0.60, size=110),\n])\nn = len(x)\nK_max = 7\n\n# Prior konjugat Dirichlet(alpha_0) + Normal-Gamma(m_0, beta_0, a_0, b_0)\nalpha_0 = 0.05  # Prior konsentrasi kecil mendorong pemangkasan komponen tak terpakai\nm_0, beta_0, a_0, b_0 = 0.0, 0.05, 1.0, 1.0\n\n# Inisialisasi posterior tanggung jawab r_nk menyebar di 7 titik kuantil awal\ninit_centers = np.linspace(x.min(), x.max(), K_max)\ndist2 = (x[:, None] - init_centers[None, :]) ** 2\nr = np.exp(-0.5 * dist2 - logsumexp(-0.5 * dist2, axis=1, keepdims=True))\n\nelbo_hist = []\nfor it in range(1, 81):\n    # Variational M-Step eksak bebas diskontinuitas pembulatan (identitas kuadratik cukup statistik)\n    Nk = np.sum(r, axis=0)\n    sx = r.T @ x\n    sx2 = r.T @ (x ** 2)\n\n    alpha_k = alpha_0 + Nk\n    beta_k = beta_0 + Nk\n    m_k = (beta_0 * m_0 + sx) / beta_k\n    a_k = a_0 + 0.5 * Nk\n    b_k = b_0 + 0.5 * np.maximum(sx2 + beta_0 * (m_0 ** 2) - beta_k * (m_k ** 2), 0.0)\n\n    # Hitung Variational ELBO (suku ekspektasi log-likelihood + KL prior-posterior)\n    e_log_pi = digamma(alpha_k) - digamma(np.sum(alpha_k))\n    e_log_tau = digamma(a_k) - np.log(b_k)\n    e_tau = a_k / b_k\n    e_sq_diff = (x[:, None] - m_k[None, :]) ** 2 + (1.0 / beta_k)[None, :]\n\n    e_ll_x = float(np.sum(r * (0.5 * e_log_tau[None, :] - 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi) - 0.5 * e_tau[None, :] * e_sq_diff)))\n    e_log_pz = float(np.sum(r * e_log_pi[None, :]))\n    e_log_qz = float(np.sum(r * np.log(np.clip(r, 1e-300, 1.0))))\n\n    kl_pi = float(\n        gammaln(np.sum(alpha_k)) - np.sum(gammaln(alpha_k))\n        - (gammaln(K_max * alpha_0) - K_max * gammaln(alpha_0))\n        + np.sum((alpha_k - alpha_0) * e_log_pi)\n    )\n    kl_ng = float(np.sum(\n        0.5 * (np.log(beta_k / beta_0) + beta_0 / beta_k - 1.0 + beta_0 * e_tau * (m_k - m_0) ** 2)\n        + a_k * np.log(b_k) - a_0 * np.log(b_0) - gammaln(a_k) + gammaln(a_0)\n        + (a_k - a_0) * e_log_tau + (b_0 - b_k) * e_tau\n    ))\n    elbo = e_ll_x + e_log_pz - e_log_qz - kl_pi - kl_ng\n    elbo_hist.append(elbo)\n\n    # Variational E-Step: perbarui log rho_nk dan tanggung jawab r_nk\n    log_rho = e_log_pi[None, :] + 0.5 * e_log_tau[None, :] - 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi) - 0.5 * e_tau[None, :] * e_sq_diff\n    r = np.exp(log_rho - logsumexp(log_rho, axis=1, keepdims=True))\n    if it > 2 and abs(elbo_hist[-1] - elbo_hist[-2]) < 1e-6:\n        break\n\npi_post = alpha_k / np.sum(alpha_k)\norder = np.argsort(pi_post)[::-1]\nelbo_diffs = np.diff(elbo_hist)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Mesin CAVI Variational Bayes GMM dari Nol (K_max=7 pada Data 3-Klaster Sejati) ===\")\nprint(f\"Iterasi Konvergen             : {len(elbo_hist)} | Min Delta ELBO = {np.min(elbo_diffs):+.2e} (Monoton!)\")\nprint(f\"ELBO Awal -> Akhir            : {elbo_hist[0]:.2f} -> {elbo_hist[-1]:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Bobot Posterior E[pi_k] Urut  : {[round(float(v), 4) for v in pi_post[order]]}\")\nprint(f\"Mean Aktif (pi_k > 0.05)      : {[round(float(m_k[idx]), 3) for idx in order if pi_post[idx] > 0.05]}\")\nprint(f\"Komponen Otomatis Dimatikan   : {int(np.sum(pi_post < 0.01))} dari {K_max} (tersisa tepat {int(np.sum(pi_post >= 0.05))} klaster!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Simulasi Stick-Breaking Dirichlet Process (Rata-Rata 500 Realisasi, K_trunc=15) ===\nalpha_0 | E[sum pi_1..3] | E[sum pi_1..5] | E[Komponen Aktif pi_k > 0.01]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    0.2 |         0.9941 |         0.9999 |                          1.91\n    1.0 |         0.8767 |         0.9669 |                          4.62\n    4.0 |         0.4763 |         0.6653 |                         10.48\n\n=== 2. Mesin CAVI Variational Bayes GMM dari Nol (K_max=7 pada Data 3-Klaster Sejati) ===\nIterasi Konvergen             : 50 | Min Delta ELBO = -2.47e-07 (Monoton!)\nELBO Awal -> Akhir            : -846.87 -> -762.43\nBobot Posterior E[pi_k] Urut  : [0.361, 0.333, 0.3054, 0.0001, 0.0001, 0.0001, 0.0001]\nMean Aktif (pi_k > 0.05)      : [0.043, -4.279, 4.52]\nKomponen Otomatis Dimatikan   : 4 dari 7 (tersisa tepat 3 klaster!)",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Simulasi Stick-Breaking Dirichlet Process (Rata-Rata 500 Realisasi, K_trunc=15) ===\nalpha_0 | E[sum pi_1..3] | E[sum pi_1..5] | E[Komponen Aktif pi_k > 0.01]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    0.2 |         0.9941 |         0.9999 |                          1.91\n    1.0 |         0.8767 |         0.9669 |                          4.62\n    4.0 |         0.4763 |         0.6653 |                         10.48\n\n=== 2. Mesin CAVI Variational Bayes GMM dari Nol (K_max=7 pada Data 3-Klaster Sejati) ===\nIterasi Konvergen             : 50 | Min Delta ELBO = -2.47e-07 (Monoton!)\nELBO Awal -> Akhir            : -846.87 -> -762.43\nBobot Posterior E[pi_k] Urut  : [0.361, 0.333, 0.3054, 0.0001, 0.0001, 0.0001, 0.0001]\nMean Aktif (pi_k > 0.05)      : [0.043, -4.279, 4.52]\nKomponen Otomatis Dimatikan   : 4 dari 7 (tersisa tepat 3 klaster!)",
          "explanation": "Mensimulasikan proses Stick-Breaking Dirichlet Process lintas konsentrasi alpha_0 (0.2, 1.0, 4.0) lalu membangun mesin 1D Variational Bayesian GMM (CAVI dengan prior Dirichlet + Normal-Gamma) dari nol yang membuktikan Variational ELBO naik monoton sambil memangkas otomatis 4 komponen redundan dari K_max=7 menjadi tepat 3 klaster aktif.",
